PARITY hook ready (debug build installed on b3ba6e19, 2026-11-23 15:40 Manila; checked on 1 row: 2.56 s, open_app Clock).

What it does: each row goes through the agent's exact model call: a fresh engine on GPU (text and vision), thinking on
(enable_thinking true), greedy (top-k 1), at most 512 new tokens, filterChannelContentFromKvCache false, one new
conversation per row, the row's PNG bytes unchanged (no resize). Output: one JSON line per row, written as it goes:
{"id", "content", "reasoning", "seconds", "firstPieceSeconds", "prefillTokens", "decodeTokens", "error"}.

Rows file: JSONL with "id", "system", "user", "image" (PNG file name, relative to the rows file's folder).

1. Push (adb runs as root on this phone, so the files must be handed to the app's user afterwards):

   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 shell mkdir -p /sdcard/Android/data/org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent/files/parity
   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 push <dir with rows.jsonl and the PNGs>/. /sdcard/Android/data/org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent/files/parity/
   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 shell 'chown -R $(stat -c %U /data/media/0/Android/data/org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent):ext_data_rw /data/media/0/Android/data/org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent/files/parity'

2. Run (all 180 rows; ~2.5 s per row plus a ~6 s load; do not start an agent run or BENCH at the same time):

   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 shell am broadcast -n org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent/.host.HostCommandReceiver \
     -a org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent.PARITY --es rows parity/rows.jsonl --es out parity/litert_phone.jsonl

   Options: --ei limit N (first N rows), --ez new_engine_per_row true (a fresh engine before every row: the #3165
   control), --ei max_tokens 512.

3. Watch / finish:

   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 logcat -s MobileAgent | grep MOBILEAGENT_PARITY     # "n/180" every 10 rows; ends with
                                                                              # MOBILEAGENT_PARITY_DONE {...} (or _ERROR)
   adb -P 15037 -s b3ba6e19 pull /sdcard/Android/data/org.experimentalmachines.mobileagent/files/parity/litert_phone.jsonl .

The DONE line has rows, errors, load ms, median seconds, thermal status at start and end (PowerManager, 0 = none).
